  "releaseNotes": "0.8.2 answers plugin requests: embedded images nest at most 8 levels (a self-embedding container fails with ImageFormatException instead of a stack overflow); plugins keep format-specific metadata in ImageMetadata (FormatMetadata records, removed by operations that move pixels); the plugin SPI and the model plugins fill are declared stable until 2.0 (docs/plugin-spi.md). No breaking changes; outputs unchanged. Notes: https://github.com/art-ix/PictureSharp/blob/v0.8.2/docs/releases/release-0.8.2.md",
